on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 23 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  7] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] jmpifz [ 15] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then
  [ 11] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 13] extcall 24 .............................. play done
  [ 15] ret
end
